.TH RECT_OVERLAPS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rect_overlaps \- Whether two rectangles overlap (share any area)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "bool rect_overlaps(Rect a, Rect b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether two rectangles overlap (share any area). The everyday collision test: bullet vs enemy, player vs pickup, entity vs trigger zone. Touching edges do not count. Test every pair with two loops; that is fast enough for hundreds of entities.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if a and b overlap.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_hit_side (3),
.BR circle_overlaps (3),
.BR rect_contains (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
